1505
01:12:50,905 --> 01:12:51,906
My <i>moko.</i>

1506
01:12:51,939 --> 01:12:54,141
Oh. Oh, yes.

1507
01:12:54,175 --> 01:12:55,810
I'm sorry, Brian.

1508
01:12:55,843 --> 01:12:56,944
