They're not
letting us overtake.

1606
01:17:53,340 --> 01:17:55,075
Slow down, ya idiot!

1607
01:17:56,410 --> 01:17:57,244
(TRUCK HORN HONKING)

1608
01:17:57,278 --> 01:17:58,345
Sister!

1609
01:17:58,379 --> 01:18:00,114
(HONKING)

1610
01:18:00,147 --> 01:18:01,315
