-(TIRES SQUEAL)

1716
01:23:15,530 --> 01:23:16,531
<i>♪ Mademoiselle</i>
<i>from Armentières ♪</i>

1717
01:23:16,564 --> 01:23:18,232
<i>♪ Parlez-vous ♪</i>

1718
01:23:18,265 --> 01:23:20,100
Have a prune.

1719
01:23:20,133 --> 01:23:21,101
SISTER MARY CLARE:
Me too, please.

1720
01:23:22,436 --> 01:23:23,437
