1875
01:31:16,010 --> 01:31:17,545
(SIGHS)

1876
01:31:27,054 --> 01:31:36,197
(♪♪♪)

1877
01:32:01,322 --> 01:32:07,995
(♪♪♪)

1878
01:32:10,297 --> 01:32:11,866
SISTER AGNES:
