1883
01:32:28,149 --> 01:32:29,316
They're not little doors?

1884
01:32:29,350 --> 01:32:31,118
No, they're not
just little doors.

1885
01:32:32,119 --> 01:32:33,554
They're big ones too.

1886
01:32:35,089 --> 01:32:35,990
